BHUNTER includes or adapts third-party components. Those components remain
under their own licenses.

- style_transfer/
  Adapted from Unsup_Recycle_GAN
  (https://github.com/wangkaihong/Unsup_Recycle_GAN), which itself builds on
  Recycle-GAN (https://github.com/aayushbansal/Recycle-GAN) and
  pytorch-CycleGAN-and-pix2pix
  (https://github.com/junyanz/pytorch-CycleGAN-and-pix2pix).
  Citation: Kaihong Wang, Kumar Akash, and Teruhisa Misu,
  "Learning Temporally and Semantically Consistent Unpaired Video-to-video
  Translation Through Pseudo-Supervision From Synthetic Optical Flow",
  AAAI 2022.

- Blindhunter/scenario_runner
  Git submodule: https://github.com/seclab-fudan/scenario_runner.git
  Based on the CARLA Scenario Runner.

- CARLA (https://carla.org/) is required to execute generated scenarios and
  is not vendored in this repository.
